OL,3,A'Our wedding present left us gutted':
OL,4,ACouple join dozens in car seller
OL,5,Adispute
OL,6,
OL,7,FNewlyweds Amber and Nathan Cooper spent
OL,8,Fall their wedding present money on a
OL,9,F#7,000 Citroen C4 to take them on their
OL,10,Fdream honeymoon.
OL,12,FBut as they made their way to Cornwall
OL,13,Fin August 2025, it lost power and began
OL,14,Fto roll backwards leaving them stranded
OL,15,Fon the A30, near the Jamaica Inn in
OL,16,FBodmin Moor, they told the BBC.
OL,18,FWhen they returned it to Trade Centre
OL,19,FUK two weeks later, they discovered it
OL,20,Fneeded a new engine, clutch and
OL,21,Fgearbox.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
